# P15 wave 2b (docs/phase15-brief.md 3.5): the developer "Audio path test"
# (apps/ipodui/apath.c). It writes /.rockbox/apath.wav on the first run
# (2 s of seeded noise, 44.1 kHz 16-bit stereo), plays it with the EQ off
# while the mixer tap (firmware/pcm_mixer.c, HAVE_IPOD_UI_DEVMODE, armed
# only during the test) hashes the frames sent to the sink from an
# 8-frame signature 0.5 s in, for 1 s, and compares with the file's own
# samples read back from the disk. In the simulator this covers the WAV
# decoder, the C DSP path, pcmbuf and the mixer (the device adds the ARM
# assembly). Developer menu rows: Debug, Back, Variant, EQ test, DAC
# standby, Audio path test.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p15-apath.script
# timeout: 90
# trace: devmode
# log: devmode enter
# log: devmode exit
# log: apath start sw_eq=
# log: apath frames=44100 hash=adbc1ad8 want=adbc1ad8 match=1
# golden: skip dev

wait 5000            # boot
wheel +3             # Settings (4th main-menu row)
wait 400
key SELECT           # Settings; About is its first row
wait 1500
key SELECT           # About
wait 1500
chord SELECT+LEFT 3200
wait 1000
wheel -2             # Advanced (above Back; the list wraps)
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +1             # Diagnostics
wait 400
key SELECT           # Audio path test is its first row
wait 800
shot dev
key SELECT           # runs about 3 s, then back in the list
wait 9000
key LEFT             # Advanced
wait 600
key LEFT             # Developer, on Advanced
wait 600
wheel +1             # the Back row
wait 400
key SELECT           # Back: leave developer mode
wait 1500
quit
